## Health with Care

As an entity operating in the healthcare sector, we feel the need to contribute to the progress of
society, which, for us, means ensuring a **better quality of life** through a more** comfortable,
empathetic,** **accessible** and **efficient healthcare**. For both doctors and patients.

## Solutions For

Addressing clinical needs is becoming an increasingly crucial aspect of our commitment. That is why
we are always listening. To help you make your clinical practice more efficient and comfortable. In
any situation.

[
Go to Solutions For
][294]

## Gender Equality Certification

Esaote S.p.A. and Ebit s.r.l. successfully completed the certification process and are now UNI/PdR
125:2022 certified. A major milestone that demonstrates Esaote’s commitment to ESG and
sustainability issues.

[
Discover more
][295]

## Esaote Product Profile

Since our foundation in the early 1980s, we have oriented our Research & Development policy towards
the creation of highly innovative products, based on careful analysis of clinical needs and market
trends.
